with the World Economic Forum,

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:12.000
which is a think tank that I respect.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.530
They actually pioneered this idea

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.620
of stakeholder capitalism decades ago,

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:17.700
well before Apple and Walmart realized

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:18.700
that it was a good idea.

