The head of the World Economic Forum

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:21.700
just launched a book

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:24.240
called literally "Stakeholder Capitalism."

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:26.620
It's an in-depth look at not only the rise

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:27.900
of Asia and China,

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.340
but also other major trends

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:30.480
that help us understand the need

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:32.030
to upgrade our capitalism.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.130
The book is really good.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:35.680
It's packed with useful
information and graphics.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:38.260
It's easy to read and to comprehend.

